<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores in the Supersport</p>
<p>Series cricket matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>In Kimberley (day three): Northern Transvaal 363 (Andre</p>
<p>Seymore 132, Martin van Jaarsveld 109, Garth Roe 4-74) and 11-0,</p>
<p>Griqualand West 541-6 dec (Pieter Barnard 212, Willie Dry 74,</p>
<p>Brett Benkenstein 62 not out).</p>
<p>In Johannesburg (day two): Transvaal 371 (Neil McKenzie 139,</p>
<p>Stefan Jacobs 85, Brett Schultz 5-64) and 14-1, Western Province</p>
<p>227 (Eric Simons 80, Paul Kirsten 50, Clive Eksteen 4-65)</p>
